  "summary": "I’m a Software Engineer & Licensed Pyrotechnic Operator with over 8 years of leadership and management experience in operations and logistics. I graduated with a Bachelor’s in Computer Science from the University of Illinois at Chicago in December 2024.\n\nI have led and collaborated on diverse technical projects, building expertise in software design, mobile development, database management, and web development.\n\nOne of my proudest achievements is developing PyroPunch — a mobile app I pitched, designed, and built for my employer. Using Flutter with Dart, Microsoft Azure Services, and a strong backend, PyroPunch is able to streamline crew scheduling, event coordination, and employee tracking for pyrotechnic displays, delivering measurable efficiency gains for the company since it's release on July 2025.\n\nMy coursework and projects have strengthened my skills in object oriented design, agile methodologies, full-stack development, mobile app development, and cloud services, including Microsoft Azure, AWS, and Google Cloud.\n\nI’m ready to bring my technical skills, problem-solving mindset, and passion for innovation to a software engineering role that makes an impact.\n\nWebsite(s):\nhttps://github.com/toonJG\nhttps://jasengarcia.me",
