    "description": "Pitched, designed, and developed PyroPunch, a Flutter/Dart + Microsoft Azure mobile application that automated over 90% of crew scheduling, reducing manager data entry from hours to just under 30 minutes.\n\nBuilt role-based access control (RBAC), geofenced punch-in/out, and device fingerprinting, achieving 98% location accuracy and reducing payroll corrections by 80%.\n\nImplemented CI pipeline using GitHub Actions to automate builds, testing, and code quality checks, cutting bug fix turnaround time to under 30 minutes.\n\nOversaw the full application lifecycle — requirements gathering, system architecture, development, testing, and deployment — aligning features with business goals and operational needs.\n\nManage large scale pyrotechnic and special effects shows, making sure to be in compliance with ATF, DOT, and state regulations, and maintaining a zero incident safety record.\n\nTrained and supervised crew members on safety standards, technical setup, and event execution for both indoor and outdoor productions.\n\nLicensed CDL driver responsible for the secure transport of explosives (1.3G / 1.4G) and flammable materials under strict safety protocols.",
